SolarWM-H3 integration

Portions of camera.py, layout.py, sampling.py, checkpoint.py, attention.py,
vae.py, and decode.py
are adapted from SolarWM, Copyright 2026 SolarWM Contributors, licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see the repository's LICENSE).

Source revision: ce1da4e7705391eda8eeda6016c0fd3f614b975e
https://github.com/Junchao-cs/SolarWM

The adaptations replace the training runtime with native vLLM-Omni modules,
fixed EMA adapter loading, and runner-owned transactional KV storage.

Camera projective arithmetic also derives from PRoPE, as vendored in SolarWM's
src/solarwm/backends/wan22/runtime/modeling/camera_prope.py and adapted in
src/solarwm/backends/minimax_h3/torch_prope.py. The original notice follows.

